WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.947
Can you guess who I am?

2
00:00:05.948 --> 00:00:09.849
I am a blue whale.

3
00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:14.026
Am I a fish? No!

4
00:00:14.027 --> 00:00:18.456
A fish is born from an egg, but I am not.

5
00:00:18.457 --> 00:00:20.646
I am a mammal!

6
00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:26.257
A fish can breathe under the water, but I cannot.

7
00:00:26.258 --> 00:00:29.969
So, I have to come out of the water to breathe.

8
00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:32.105
Look at me breathe!

9
00:00:32.106 --> 00:00:40.765
I spout water high into the air.

10
00:00:40.766 --> 00:00:44.510
I am the biggest of all living animals.

11
00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:49.602
I am longer than five buses.

12
00:00:49.603 --> 00:00:53.275
I am the heaviest kind of whale.

13
00:00:53.276 --> 00:00:58.592
I weigh more than twenty elephants.

14
00:00:58.593 --> 00:01:02.553
But I can dive very deep.

15
00:01:02.554 --> 00:01:08.188
Then, I can quickly swim back up again.

16
00:01:08.189 --> 00:01:11.479
You think I eat the largest fish, don't you?

17
00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:19.103
No, I just eat the smallest creatures in the ocean.

18
00:01:19.104 --> 00:01:21.815
They are called plankton.

19
00:01:21.816 --> 00:01:24.437
I also eat krill.

20
00:01:24.438 --> 00:01:27.747
I like krill the best.

21
00:01:27.748 --> 00:01:30.655
I have no teeth.

22
00:01:30.656 --> 00:01:35.026
I just have a row of 320 plates.

23
00:01:35.027 --> 00:01:38.662
The plates help me catch my food.

24
00:01:38.663 --> 00:01:41.336
Let me show you how I eat.

25
00:01:41.337 --> 00:01:48.093
First, I gulp a large mouthful of water.

26
00:01:48.094 --> 00:01:52.379
Then, I push the water out of my mouth.

27
00:01:52.380 --> 00:02:00.261
Finally, I lick the small creatures off my plates with my huge tongue.

28
00:02:00.262 --> 00:02:05.544
I am an amazing creature! Ha-ha!

29
00:02:05.545 --> 00:02:09.556
When you sail on the ocean, wave at me.

30
00:02:09.557 --> 00:02:18.935
Then, I will salute you!

